# Module 8 - Rocket Elevators Admin Dashboard

## Project Overview
Full-stack MERN application for managing real estate agents and transactions.

## Features Implemented
### Core Requirements
- ✅ User authentication with JWT sessions (24-hour expiration)
- ✅ Protected routes requiring login
- ✅ Agent Management (display all agents)
- ✅ Transaction Management (create and view last 10)
- ✅ MongoDB database with 4 collections
- ✅ RESTful API with Express.js

### Enhancements (Beyond Requirements)
- ✅ Full CRUD operations on agents (Create, Read, Update, Delete)
- ✅ Search functionality (by ID, name, email)
- ✅ Sort by multiple columns (name, region, rating, fee)
- ✅ Confirmation modals before destructive actions
- ✅ Success/error alerts with auto-dismiss
- ✅ Responsive Bootstrap design
- ✅ Currency and date formatting
- ✅ Form validation with error messages

### Bonus Content (Separate Branch)
- ✅ Reports Dashboard with Chart.js
- ✅ Bar chart: Total transaction amounts by agent
- ✅ Line chart: Daily transaction trends (14 days)
- ✅ Single API endpoint for all chart data

## Technology Stack
**Frontend:** React 18, Vite, React Router, React Bootstrap, Chart.js
**Backend:** Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, Mongoose
**Authentication:** JWT, bcrypt, cookie-parser
**Tools:** Git, Thunder Client, VS Code

## Installation
```bash
# Clone repository
git clone git@github.com:ArmstrongValoree/Module-Eight-Rocket-Elevators.git

# Install dependencies
cd Module-Eight-Rocket-Elevators/server && npm install
cd ../client && npm install

# Seed database
cd server
node scripts/seedUser.js
node scripts/seedAgents.js

# Run application
cd server && npm run dev
cd client && npm run dev
```

## API Endpoints
- POST /session - Login
- GET /validate_token - Validate session
- GET /agents - Get all agents
- POST /agents - Create agent
- PUT /agents/:id - Update agent
- DELETE /agents/:id - Delete agent
- GET /transaction-data - Get last 10 transactions
- POST /transaction - Create transaction
- GET /report-data - Get chart data (Bonus branch only)

## Branches
- `dev` - Main development (core + enhancements)
- `Bonus` - Includes Reports Dashboard with charts